    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord!</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203270/extras/ccbb3baa29ec54ad004e2eee864c7535.avif?t=1679490025\" /></div> Join our Discord-server! </p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><i>Imagine if there was a place,<br>a pandemonium of walls, towers and dungeons,<br>and now suppose, here, in these dark halls, you were left for dead,<br>subjected to the wrath of countless sinners from an ancient world. . .<br><br>But you don\u2019t belong here yet. . .<br>So escape!<br>Before even your soul is consumed<br>by the Labyrinth. . .</i><br><br>A challenging Dante-inspired horror adventure including, obscure puzzles, vile creatures, blood-curdling combat, devious traps and a dark and terrible lore. <br>A game about escaping a heinous and unholy place.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SOLVE PUZZLES</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203270/extras/302eaaecd9179dce7da1322d35ff6f55.poster.avif?t=1679490025\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203270/extras/302eaaecd9179dce7da1322d35ff6f55.webm?t=1679490025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203270/extras/302eaaecd9179dce7da1322d35ff6f55.mp4?t=1679490025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The Labyrinth is filled with countless puzzles and mysteries for you to uncover. Which treasures lie waiting for you. . .<br>And what secrets may be best left unsolved?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEFEAT DESPICABLE CREATURES</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203270/extras/a062c6f11005de5c8c9e449df2b32b94.poster.avif?t=1679490025\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203270/extras/a062c6f11005de5c8c9e449df2b32b94.webm?t=1679490025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203270/extras/a062c6f11005de5c8c9e449df2b32b94.mp4?t=1679490025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Terrifying enemies lie waiting behind every corner.<br>Be ready to defend your life in a moments notice or face running blind in the dark.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">REVEAL ITS SINISTER PAST</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203270/extras/48a435eeef3e055fbfdf8e884a5ca6ef.poster.avif?t=1679490025\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203270/extras/48a435eeef3e055fbfdf8e884a5ca6ef.webm?t=1679490025\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2203270/extras/48a435eeef3e055fbfdf8e884a5ca6ef.mp4?t=1679490025\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Uncover the past of the Labyrinth by exploring and finding key locations and items.<br>Track your progress in an immersive notebook and put your investigative skill to the test.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>-\tA First-Person narrative horror game<br>-\tExplore and uncover the long-lost past<br>-\tSolve puzzles and discover what secrets lie beyond them<br>-\tFight the corrupted souls of The Labyrinth",
